{"id":"604370","name":"什锦炒饭","author":"筠旸JY","authorId":"7345450","desc":"","cover":"images/604370/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豌豆","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米粒","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"米饭适量，鸡蛋炒碎盛出备用。","img":"images/604370/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜洋葱切成小丁，玉米粒剥好，豌豆提前放入开水锅里面烫一下捞出备用。","img":"images/604370/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅内放少许油烧热，然后放入洋葱粒炒出香味。","img":"images/604370/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入豌豆胡萝卜玉米粒中火翻炒均匀。","img":"images/604370/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入米饭。","img":"images/604370/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒散，米饭不能太软哦。","img":"images/604370/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入炒好的鸡蛋。","img":"images/604370/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加少许盐调味。","img":"images/604370/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入一点点生抽调味，继续翻炒均匀即可出锅。","img":"images/604370/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"装入容器中。","img":"images/604370/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/604370/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/604370/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}